cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CAPRI-Python
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it, and cite the original CAPRI
  model separately -- this is an independent reimplementation, not a
  release of the CAPRI modelling system.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of the CAPRI (Common Agricultural Policy
  Regionalised Impact) model, covering the regional PMP supply module,
  an Armington market module, CAP policy instruments and environmental
  indicators, calibrated against data extracted from CAPRI star-3.0.
references:
  - type: software
    title: CAPRI modelling system
    notes: >-
      The original CAPRI model, developed at the University of Bonn and
      partner institutions. See https://www.capri-model.org
